    "body": "## Problem and resulting behavior\n\nCheap chart decoding still lacked useful ECDLP relations. This update tests growing leaf rank and a different source reduction. Arbitrary leaf-polynomial multipliers of F1W²/F2 retain the same five-entry curve code: the least nonzero leaf coefficient supplies a witness with no degree/index union charge. The D=0 first-equation-only branch is retained. Full weighted-norm/asymptotic transfer remains hand analysis. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n\nA projective subresultant gives (x-y)²F2-(T-wW)²F1=V*R, with R of lower profile(1,2). On V!=0,x!=y, retaining F1 and R is equivalent to both original equations; every V=0 or x=y branch keeps the original system. The actual finite S3 equivalence and diagonal zero-polynomial control compile. Division by V is explicit finite-chart saturation, not ordinary-ideal membership of R without V. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n\nFull source/projective coefficients recover both offsets and the curve parameters. Four entries suffice for the finite curve-code bound(2T+1)^4 in the scalar residual family. Separate finite universal-pool arithmetic gives p<729Q² under explicit height/capacity/complete-cover premises. These do not establish useful yield for adaptive subsets or growing polynomial multiples of the saturated residual. Capped selector search remains unimplemented. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n\n## Validation and limits\n\n- Final shared canonical gate002:526 theorems,0 failures,0 trusted native. Delta52 from474 is27 named owner laws+10 symbolic applications+15 defining equations. Named and transitive dependencies are standard only. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n- Gate001 was aborted after a failed application check was noticed. Its incorrect intermediate pass journal entry has an explicit append-only correction. Final actual005 passes; the corrected source commit precedes gate002. Raw errors/warnings/aborted receipt remain, with no proof-limit/trust/inventory/linter exception. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n- All346 subject hashes match; published0ab's19-row ledger is an exact byte/parsed prefix of20 rows. New55-subject interpretive attestation remains unverified; no independent signed verdict or identity certificate. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n\nFull modular-row/weighted-norm and asymptotic model transfer, actual projective pool count instantiation, and the proposed growing-residual support/rank/determinant diagnostic retain HAND scope. No complete classical subexponential prime-field ECDLP algorithm, useful original relation yield or measured speed. These results do not exclude every adaptive, saturated, higher-rank or longer-chain family. [pcc:PCC-20261116-0e8ec7]\n\nNo new scientific/numerical/curve/LLL/native qualification, paid job, image build/pull or submission. The older first-endpoint Sage control is still UNEXECUTED;1PythonAST/1JSON parse only. Its70210 prospective pairs and2USD proposal are not observations, a grant or known balance. Live shared cost and actual runtime/image/caller/capacity/custody admission remain missing. [pcc:PCC-20261116-e6dc6e]\n\nReports: docs/leaf-module-anchors-20261116.md and docs/projective-subresultant-20261116.md; scope: docs/selector-module-subresultant-20261116/PUBLICATION.md. Earlier pinned source/plan/report/PDF/control/raw evidence and the unrelated Velu probe are unchanged.\n",
